  "description": "The native payload for Agora's local face detection extension (full-face-detect 4.6.4 on Maven Central), packaged for .NET for Android. Reports whether a face is in frame and how far away it is — used to auto-adjust exposure and capture, or to pause the stream when nobody is there. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Android or Net.Agora.Voice.Android — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is RtcEngine.EnableFaceDetection in the RTC binding.",
